{"seq":2,"slug":"artifact-promotion-pipeline","title":"制品晋升管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/release-process/artifact-promotion-pipeline","wordCount":1409,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"制品晋升管道\">制品晋升管道</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>制品晋升管道的核心原则是&quot;构建一次，到处部署&quot;——同一个制品不重新构建，通过质量门逐阶段晋升（Dev → Staging → RC → Production）。每个阶段附加验证但不改变制品内容，确保测试通过的和上线的是同一个东西。质量门定义了自动化的晋升条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"制品不变性原则-构建一次-到处部署\">制品不变性原则：构建一次，到处部署</h2><p>制品晋升管道（Artifact Promotion Pipeline）的核心哲学是：<strong>软件制品在整个生命周期中不应被重新构建</strong>。同一个二进制文件、同一个容器镜像、同一个 npm tarball——从开发环境一路晋升到生产环境，每次晋升只是改变元数据标签，不改变制品内容。</p>\n<p>为什么不能重新构建？因为每次构建引入非确定性——依赖解析时间不同、编译器缓存状态不同、环境变量不同——都可能导致&quot;测试通过的和上线的不是同一个东西&quot;。制品不变性消除了这个风险。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>hash</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>artifact</mtext><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>hash</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>artifact</mtext><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>hash</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>artifact</mtext><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{hash}(\\text{artifact}_{dev}) = \\text{hash}(\\text{artifact}_{staging}) = \\text{hash}(\\text{artifact}_{prod})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hash</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">artifact</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hash</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">artifact</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hash</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">artifact</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"晋升管道的阶段模型\">晋升管道的阶段模型</h2><p>典型的制品晋升管道包含以下阶段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    B[构建] --&gt; D[开发]&#10;    D --&gt;|质量门 1| S[预发布]&#10;    S --&gt;|质量门 2| R[RC/灰度]&#10;    R --&gt;|质量门 3| P[生产]&#10;    P --&gt;|回滚| R\">flowchart LR\n    B[构建] --&gt; D[开发]\n    D --&gt;|质量门 1| S[预发布]\n    S --&gt;|质量门 2| R[RC/灰度]\n    R --&gt;|质量门 3| P[生产]\n    P --&gt;|回滚| R</pre><p>每个阶段对应不同的验证级别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>验证内容</th>\n<th>持续时间</th>\n<th>决策者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>构建（Build）</td>\n<td>编译、单元测试、SAST</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开发（Dev）</td>\n<td>集成测试、API 契约测试</td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预发布（Staging）</td>\n<td>E2E 测试、性能基准</td>\n<td>天级</td>\n<td>自动+人工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RC/灰度（Canary）</td>\n<td>小比例真实流量验证</td>\n<td>天级</td>\n<td>SRE 观测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产（Production）</td>\n<td>全量发布</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>审批</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"质量门的设计原则\">质量门的设计原则</h2><p>质量门（Quality Gate）是晋升的前提条件——制品必须满足全部条件才能进入下一阶段。</p>\n<h3 id=\"质量门的层级\">质量门的层级</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>工具示例</th>\n<th>失败后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 基础</td>\n<td>编译通过、lint 绿、单元测试通过</td>\n<td>GCC/TSC、ESLint、Jest</td>\n<td>阻止进入 Dev</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 集成</td>\n<td>API 契约验证、依赖兼容性</td>\n<td>Pact、Renovate</td>\n<td>阻止进入 Staging</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 系统</td>\n<td>E2E 场景覆盖、性能回归检测</td>\n<td>Playwright、k6</td>\n<td>阻止进入 RC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 运营</td>\n<td>Canary 错误率 &lt; 阈值、SLO 满足</td>\n<td>Prometheus、PagerDuty</td>\n<td>阻止全量发布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>质量门必须满足两个原则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>可自动执行</strong>：不依赖人工判断（减少瓶颈）</li>\n<li><strong>有明确阈值</strong>：不是&quot;感觉还行&quot;，而是&quot;错误率 &lt; 0.1%&quot;</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"质量门的数学表达\">质量门的数学表达</h3><p>对于灰度阶段，常用的统计决策方法：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>晋升条件</mtext><mo>:</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>error</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>error</mtext><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{晋升条件}: p(\\text{error}_{canary}) \\leq p(\\text{error}_{baseline}) + \\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">晋升条件</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">error</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ana</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">error</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 是可接受的误差裕度。Kayenta（Netflix/Google 开源的金丝雀分析工具）使用 Mann-Whitney U 检验来判断灰度流量的指标是否显著优于/等于基线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容器镜像的晋升实践\">容器镜像的晋升实践</h2><p>以 OCI 容器镜像为例，制品晋升通过 tag 管理实现：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Registry&#10;        I[myapp:sha-abc123]&#10;        I --&gt;|tag| T1[myapp:dev-20260718]&#10;        I --&gt;|promote| T2[myapp:staging-20260718]&#10;        I --&gt;|promote| T3[myapp:rc-1]&#10;        I --&gt;|promote| T4[myapp:1.5.0]&#10;        I --&gt;|promote| T5[myapp:latest]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Registry\n        I[myapp:sha-abc123]\n        I --&gt;|tag| T1[myapp:dev-20260718]\n        I --&gt;|promote| T2[myapp:staging-20260718]\n        I --&gt;|promote| T3[myapp:rc-1]\n        I --&gt;|promote| T4[myapp:1.5.0]\n        I --&gt;|promote| T5[myapp:latest]\n    end</pre><p>关键实践：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>内容寻址</strong>：用 digest（<code>sha256:abc...</code>）而非 tag 标识制品，tag 只是别名</li>\n<li><strong>不可变 tag</strong>：版本 tag（如 <code>1.5.0</code>）一旦指向某个 digest 就不再移动</li>\n<li><strong>可变 tag</strong>：环境 tag（如 <code>staging</code>）随晋升移动，指向最新通过质量门的制品</li>\n<li><strong>多架构清单</strong>：<code>manifest list</code> 包含 amd64/arm64 等多平台镜像</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"制品元数据与可追溯性\">制品元数据与可追溯性</h2><p>每个制品在晋升过程中应携带足够的元数据以支持审计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>元数据</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>源码 commit</td>\n<td>Git SHA</td>\n<td>构建时注入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建编号</td>\n<td>CI job ID</td>\n<td>CI 系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建时间</td>\n<td>UTC 时间戳</td>\n<td>构建时注入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖清单</td>\n<td>SBOM（SPDX/CycloneDX）</td>\n<td>构建时生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签名</td>\n<td>Sigstore bundle</td>\n<td>构建后签名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>来源证明</td>\n<td>SLSA provenance</td>\n<td>构建系统生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>晋升历史</td>\n<td>各阶段通过时间</td>\n<td>制品管理系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>GitHub Actions 的 <code>actions/attest-build-provenance</code>（2024-05 GA）将构建来源证明直接附加到制品上，使用 Sigstore 无密钥签名——详见<a href=\"../automation-tooling/signing-provenance\">签名与来源证明</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"制品仓库的分区策略\">制品仓库的分区策略</h2><p>企业级制品管理系统（如 JFrog Artifactory、Sonatype Nexus）通常按生命周期阶段分区：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>仓库类型</th>\n<th>写入权限</th>\n<th>保留策略</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>snapshot/dev</td>\n<td>CI 系统</td>\n<td>7 天自动清理</td>\n<td>开发期制品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>staging</td>\n<td>晋升管道</td>\n<td>30 天</td>\n<td>通过 L2 质量门的制品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>release</td>\n<td>晋升管道</td>\n<td>永久</td>\n<td>正式发布的制品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>archive</td>\n<td>管理员</td>\n<td>按合规要求</td>\n<td>历史版本归档</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分区隔离确保：开发制品不会被误部署到生产，生产制品不会被覆盖或删除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"晋升管道的反模式\">晋升管道的反模式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>改进</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每环境重新构建</td>\n<td>制品不一致</td>\n<td>构建一次，tag 晋升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动晋升</td>\n<td>人为错误、瓶颈</td>\n<td>自动化质量门驱动晋升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无回退路径</td>\n<td>问题制品无法撤回</td>\n<td>保留上一个已知良好版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过多人工审批</td>\n<td>速度瓶颈</td>\n<td>只在最终阶段要求人工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忽略 SBOM</td>\n<td>无法审计依赖</td>\n<td>构建时生成并签名 SBOM</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关于<a href=\"release-train-cadence\">发布火车</a>如何与晋升管道的时间窗口对齐，以及制品在生产环境出现问题时的<a href=\"hotfix-emergency-release\">热修复流程</a>，分别在同章的前后两篇中讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>制品不变性原则消除了&quot;测试的和上线的不是同一个东西&quot;的风险</li>\n<li>质量门必须可自动执行且有明确阈值，避免依赖人工判断</li>\n<li>容器镜像通过 digest 标识内容，tag 只是别名——版本 tag 不可变</li>\n<li>制品元数据（SBOM、签名、来源证明）支撑全生命周期的可追溯性</li>\n<li>制品仓库按生命周期阶段分区，配合保留策略管理存储成本</li>\n<li>常见反模式：每环境重新构建、手动晋升、无回退路径</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"制品晋升管道","id":"制品晋升管道"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"制品不变性原则：构建一次，到处部署","id":"制品不变性原则-构建一次-到处部署"},{"level":2,"text":"晋升管道的阶段模型","id":"晋升管道的阶段模型"},{"level":2,"text":"质量门的设计原则","id":"质量门的设计原则"},{"level":3,"text":"质量门的层级","id":"质量门的层级"},{"level":3,"text":"质量门的数学表达","id":"质量门的数学表达"},{"level":2,"text":"容器镜像的晋升实践","id":"容器镜像的晋升实践"},{"level":2,"text":"制品元数据与可追溯性","id":"制品元数据与可追溯性"},{"level":2,"text":"制品仓库的分区策略","id":"制品仓库的分区策略"},{"level":2,"text":"晋升管道的反模式","id":"晋升管道的反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"发布火车与节奏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/release-process/release-train-cadence"},"next":{"title":"热修复与紧急发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/release-process/hotfix-emergency-release"}}